[13.730025, "o", "teleprompt doctor\r\n  scene adapters   asciinema, mock, playwright, remotion, slidev, vhs\r\n  capture          vhs (vhs) \u2014 vhs and ttyd is not on PATH, playwright (playwright), remotion (remotion), slidev (slidev), asciinema (asciinema), mock (mock)\r\n  voice backends   kokoro, null\r\n  manifest         narration v2\r\n  cache            .teleprompt/cache/voice \u2014 0 entries, 0 bytes\r\n  cache            .teleprompt/cache/compose \u2014 0 entries, 0 bytes\r\n  ffmpeg           ffmpeg version 6.1.1-3ubuntu5 Copyright (c) 2000-2023 the FFmpeg developers\r\n  note             build renders with ffmpeg as a subprocess; check, plan, diff and dub need none.\r\n  note             an item whose scene nothing here can record holds its slot with a slate; `capture` says which.\r\n  note             no external runtime ships with teleprompt: Node, Playwright, Remotion, Slidev and agg are needed only to capture the scenes that use them.\r\n  note             dub writes 16-bit PCM WAV; each manifest's `audio` block records the rate and channel count the backend produced.\r\n"]
